# Code architecture

- Apply SOLID. Small focused classes and functions. Depend on abstractions. Inject dependencies.
- Design stable abstractions for how a component might change, not for every hypothetical.
- Compose at the root so tests can substitute collaborators. Instantiate concrete classes only at the composition root, not deep in the tree.
